# M9 9.5 gate: a program-defined menu becomes the menubar app pad;
# Alt+A opens the pad, Down+Enter picks the File pad whose ON PAD command
# runs into the Command window.
text DEFINE MENU app
key enter
text DEFINE PAD file OF app PROMPT "\<File"
key enter
text ON PAD file OF app ? "app pad fired"
key enter
text ACTIVATE MENU app
key enter
key alt-a
key down
key enter
key esc
eof
